<title>USA: Famous Dave's to buy restaurant site.</title>
<headline>Famous Dave's to buy restaurant site.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Famous Dave's of America Inc said it agreed to buy a building in Grand Chute, Wis., near Appleton, to be converted to a Famous Dave's Bar-B-Que.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to open the restaurant in September 1997.</p>
<p>Famous Dave's operates four Famous Dave's restaurants, with seven additional locations in development.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
